    "long_instructions": "## Revisiting your Vision\r\n\r\nThis level has your same webpage from earlier. Now's your chance to continue building it to truly match your vision. You get to decide how you want to work with AI Tutor as a collaborator.\r\n\r\n**Do This:**\r\n- Continue to update your webpage until it matches your vision!\r\n  - If you decide you'd like to start over: you can use the <i class=\"fa-history fa-solid\"></i> Version History tab to reset to the Initial Version\r\n\r\n**When to Continue?** This level isn't like earlier ones, where you just need to do one or two things and be done. You can spend _as much time as you want_ in this level making updates to your website. You get to decide when you're done!\r\n\r\n_Optional:_ Once you've made your webpage, you can press the Share button at the top to send it to a friend! You can also press the Remix button to save this webpage to your own project gallery.",
